---

<LocationSeoTemplate
  title="Plots Near Commercial Areas in DHA Phase 6 Lahore"
  metaTitle="Plots Near Commercial Areas in DHA Phase 6 Lahore | CCA & Boulevard"
  description="Explore commercial and residential plots near CCA 1, CCA 2, and Main Boulevard in DHA Phase 6 Lahore. Compare commercial yields, plot sizes, and price snapshots."
  canonical={canonical}
  badge="Commercial & Urban Intelligence"
  headline="Plots Near Commercial Centers & Boulevards in DHA Phase 6"
  lead="A comprehensive investment guide to commercial land and walkable residential plots situated near CCA 1, CCA 2, Raya Commercial, and Main Boulevard in DHA Phase 6 Lahore."
  statPills={[
    { value: 'CCA 1 & 2', label: 'Core Commercial Zones' },
    { value: '4M & 8M', label: 'Prime Commercial Sizes' },
    { value: '5-8%', label: 'Commercial Rental Yield Band' },
    { value: 'Walkable', label: 'Residential Proximity Advantage' },
  ]}
  editorialParagraphs={[
    'In premium master-planned developments like DHA Phase 6 Lahore, the relationship between commercial infrastructure and property value is paramount. Proximity to vibrant retail, financial institutions, and dining destinations is the single greatest catalyst for both capital appreciation and everyday lifestyle convenience.',
    'Phase 6 features distinct, purpose-zoned commercial centers. CCA 1 serves the western and central sectors with grocery supermarkets, corporate banks, and retail outlets. CCA 2 anchors the eastern half, providing state-of-the-art diagnostic labs, fitness centers, and casual dining. Spanning the entire phase is the prestigious 120-foot Main Boulevard, accommodating flagship banks, car showrooms, and corporate offices.',
    'For commercial investors, 4 Marla and 8 Marla commercial plots in CCA 1, CCA 2, and Main Boulevard offer lucrative development potential. Multi-story plazas let to reputable corporate tenants generate strong, inflation-hedged rental returns and unmatched long-term asset security under DHA Lahore’s stringent property protections.',
    'For residential buyers, acquiring a residential plot located 150 to 300 meters from a CCA hub represents the ultimate "walkable urban living" experience in Lahore. Homeowners can stroll to pick up morning groceries, visit the bank, or grab coffee without the hassle of vehicular traffic, while remaining shielded from commercial noise on dedicated residential lanes.',
  ]}
  placesTitle="Top Commercial Hubs & Verified Businesses in DHA Phase 6"
  placesSubtitle="Verified banks, supermarkets, and dining destinations across CCA and Main Boulevard."
  places={commercialHubPlaces}
  allPlacesCategoryUrl="/places/supermarkets/"
  allPlacesCategoryLabel="Browse All Supermarkets & Commercial Retailers"
  tableTitle="Commercial Centers & Surrounding Plot Valuation Matrix"
  tableSubtitle="Compare commercial land formats, residential proximity, travel times, and current market demand."
  tableRows={tableRows}
  propertiesTitle="Featured Commercial & Residential Plot Snapshots"
  propertiesSubtitle="Representative market asking price snapshots in CCA 1, CCA 2, and Main Boulevard."
  properties={displayProperties}
  zameenSearchUrl="https://www.zameen.com/Commercial_Plots/Lahore_Defence__DHA__Phase_6-1448-1.html"
  zameenSearchLabel="Search Commercial Plots on Zameen.com ↗"
  checklistTitle="Commercial Land & Proximity Buyer Checklist"
  checklistBullets={[
    'Commercial Zoning & Permitted Use: Confirm exact permitted commercial usage (retail, corporate office, restaurant, medical) with DHA planning authorities before signing.',
    'Road Frontage & Parking Ratios: Inspect the plot road width (minimum 60-foot or 120-foot) and ensure adequate municipal parking courts are available in front of the site.',
    'Building Height & Basement Bylaws: Verify the permitted number of floors (Basement + Ground + Upper Floors) and floor-area ratios (FAR) applicable to the specific block.',
    'Utility Load Capacity: Verify high-amperage commercial electrical transformer availability, backup generator space, and high-volume commercial water and sewerage connections.',
    'Residential Distance Buffer: When purchasing residential land near commercial zones, choose plots situated at least 1 to 2 streets behind the commercial rear line for noise protection.',
    'Transfer Dues & Tax Calculations: Factor in commercial transfer fees, advance taxes (236K/236C), and municipal development charges which differ substantially from residential land.',
  ]}
  faqs={faqs}
  relatedLinks={relatedLinks}
/>
